{"id": "m54", "type": "版本", "question": "v2 生效后，A 团队之前按 v1 提交、还在验收期内的在途事项会被 v2 重新计算吗？", "outcome": "pass", "run_id": "49fd4306-0c7e-4582-825e-a31934a980a2", "elapsed_ms": 8748, "answer": "不会；v2 不自动追溯变更旧提交约定，之前按 v1 提交的在途事项仍按提交日期适用 v1 计算。", "error_class": null, "error_detail": null, "citations": ["C1", "C2"], "gold_top5": [{"anchor": "A-D2-01", "in_top5": true}, {"anchor": "A-F2-06", "in_top5": true}], "gold_top20": [{"anchor": "A-D2-01", "in_top20": true}, {"anchor": "A-F2-06", "in_top20": true}], "must_not": [{"phrase": "在途期限按 v2 重算或缩短", "leaked": false}]}
{"id": "m55", "type": "版本", "question": "A 团队 2026-10-06 提交的交付，适用 v2.1 的 4 个工作日吗？现在该按几天？", "outcome": "pass", "run_id": "b6174607-3e4b-4090-a908-b9c1b98705db", "elapsed_ms": 19156, "answer": "A 团队 2026-10-06 提交的交付不适用 v2.1 的 4 个工作日，因为 v2.1 已废止且效力回到 v2。 该提交自 2026-10-01 起适用当前 v2，现在应按 3 个工作日。", "error_class": null, "error_detail": null, "citations": ["C1", "C3", "C4", "C5"], "gold_top5": [{"anchor": "A-P1-02", "in_top5": false}, {"anchor": "A-P1-01", "in_top5": false}], "gold_top20": [{"anchor": "A-P1-02", "in_top20": false}, {"anchor": "A-P1-01", "in_top20": false}], "must_not": [{"phrase": "按 4 个工作日给出现行期限", "leaked": false}]}
{"id": "m56", "type": "版本", "question": "交付规则 v3 草案把验收期缩短成了 2 个工作日，A 团队现在提交的能按 2 个工作日算吗？", "outcome": "pass", "run_id": "ec934b58-e79c-4669-84d1-c09636a2f0e9", "elapsed_ms": 13632, "answer": "A 团队现在提交的不能按 2 个工作日算，当前应按 v2 的 3 个工作日验收期限。 v3 草案尚未生效，要到 2026-12-01 才可能生效且数值仍可能调整。", "error_class": null, "error_detail": null, "citations": ["C1", "C2"], "gold_top5": [{"anchor": "A-D3-01", "in_top5": false}, {"anchor": "A-F2-08", "in_top5": true}], "gold_top20": [{"anchor": "A-D3-01", "in_top20": false}, {"anchor": "A-F2-08", "in_top20": true}], "must_not": [{"phrase": "把草案的 2 个工作日当作现行标准", "leaked": false}]}
